// Converted 1:1 from apps/web/src/app/workbench/useComposerPipeline.ts (CXU plugins @ f2cb649d). Bulk conversion pass — defects logged, not yet fixed.
// Hook returning { startCodexTurn } — the main send pipeline (682 source
// lines, one useCallback). DEFECT: React hooks semantics — plain function
// over the ComposerCoreInput bundle. DEFECT: async — synchronous + status
// code; the TS return `Promise<string | null>` becomes (status, out_threadId)
// where status 0 = threadId returned, 1 = null returned, 2 = error path
// already handled internally (also returns null in TS). Nested closures
// (clearSendDedupe, startNewTurn, stopReviewAndStart) become sibling
// functions taking an explicit frame struct — closure capture is lost and
// recorded as a defect. Set/Map updater closures, Date.now/Math.random,
// window.clearTimeout and console.* are placeholders.

